%% Billing — the life of a subscription Community Engine renews, in Pay's own status vocabulary.
stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> active: first order paid (Start)
  active --> active: renewal invoice paid (Renew advances the period)
  active --> active: cancel at end → ends_at set, resume clears it
  active --> past_due: period ended unpaid (grace_ends_at = end + grace_days)
  past_due --> active: invoice paid inside the grace
  past_due --> unpaid: grace over (ends_at = grace_ends_at; period lapsed)
  unpaid --> active: invoice paid late → restarts from the day paid
  unpaid --> past_due: a steward gives more time
  active --> canceled: cancelled and ends_at reached, or cancelled now
  canceled --> [*]
